== Trivia ==
* The bonus damage from the {{AbilityName|King of the Jungle}} perk is part of the [[Damage Calculation|additive damage multiplier]], hence it is suppressed by other factors, such as {{Skl|Combat|level}} and [[Enchantments]]. This means that the actual damage increase from this perk is much lower.
* The damage from the {{AbilityName|Primal Force}} perk is multiplicative with other factors, such as the {{ench|One For All}} Enchantment and {{Skl|Catacombs|level}}.

